# Local analysis workspace. The raw material (user-provided EPUB parses, OCR dumps
# of Lewis & Short, the 32 MB LSJ index) is never redistributed. Our own evidence
# records ARE tracked: an audit that cannot be re-read after a clone is not an
# audit.
analysis/*
# full-text reference dumps are never redistributed
analysis/reference/
analysis/backups/
analysis/greek-index.json
analysis/_*.py
# evidence records and audit summaries are part of the repository
